{
  "_README": [
    "Loot config for the mondungeons raid dungeon. One source of truth: the UI odds display AND the end-of-run spin both read THIS file.",
    "How a payout is rolled: (1) pick a reward tier using the player's key tier `tierOdds`, (2) pick an item inside that tier using the item `weight`s.",
    "`tierOdds` values are percentages and sum to 100 per key. `weight` values inside a tier are relative; normalize them at runtime.",
    "`chestWeight` is how often each KEY tier spawns in chests (relative weight, lower = rarer) — not part of the payout roll.",
    "IMPORTANT: every `item` id below is a BEST GUESS. Replace each with the exact registry id from the installed mod before shipping. Cobblemon / Mega Showdown ids are barely in model training data — verify against the real registries, do not trust these strings. Entries with `\"verify\": true` are the ones most likely wrong.",
    "Pokemon rewards use Cobblemon's spec/bucket system: `type` is `pokemon` and `spec` is a Pokemon properties string. Tune the specs to what you want to hand out.",
    "All numbers are drafts for balancing."
  ],

